  "notes": "OAK CAST-AWAY RP2040 pinout graphic. Right side labels A2/D28 etc.: no GPIO name printed, D-number used as label and A-name as function. Right-side board silkscreen is small and upside down (looks like 5V/GND/3V3/A2/A1/A0) and was not added to functions. Category legend (Digital IO, Analog IO, I2C 0, SPI 0, GND, Power) omitted. BOOT and RESET buttons skipped."
